<title>USA: Florida to sell $13.26 mln revenue bonds Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $13.26 mln revenue bonds Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $13.26 million of Department of Management Services revenue bonds by competitive bid at 11 a.m. EDT on Wednesday the Division of Bond Finance said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issue is Department of Management Services, Division of Facilities Management, Florida Facililties Pool revenue bonds, Series 1997 A.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
